00:02:32.723 --> 00:02:35.385
- I have no idea what I look like!

00:02:35.385 --> 00:02:37.823
- My face actually feels less oily.

00:02:37.823 --> 00:02:40.749
- I'm really excited to look. (laughs)

00:02:40.749 --> 00:02:42.394
- Oh, my god! (laughs)

00:02:42.394 --> 00:02:44.182
I look really bad ass!

00:02:45.392 --> 00:02:47.850
- Oh, my god! (laughs)

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:50.085
I'm like afraid to look again. (laughs)

00:02:50.085 --> 00:02:53.315
- Hot damn! (laughs)

00:02:53.315 --> 00:02:57.054
- I would never know that I
looked like a clown before this.

00:02:57.054 --> 00:02:58.517
I feel like I'm a painting.

00:02:58.517 --> 00:03:00.143
- My best Ruby Rose look?

00:03:00.143 --> 00:03:04.801
Oh, I can give you like
a little eyebrow thing.

00:03:07.029 --> 00:03:10.301
- I like that it's made
makeup not as intimidating.

00:03:10.301 --> 00:03:12.799
It kind of has to happen in steps.

00:03:12.799 --> 00:03:15.381
- Even if, like, I love the
way I look without makeup,

00:03:15.381 --> 00:03:17.493
by putting on certain types of makeup

00:03:17.493 --> 00:03:20.703
or certain colors, like,
it enhances my personality

00:03:20.703 --> 00:03:22.125
